 "notes": [
  "Kit batch kit-batch-8504-20261121 (2026-11-21), group 1 (Indische Buurt). Front only: the 34 m Celebesstraat wall from w01-78L (2020-02-17, leaf-off; the 2020-05 and 2021 crops are behind a tree in leaf).",
  "Groups: 0 the south half (3DBAG surface 96, 15 m): five storeys, French windows with clear glass rail balconettes on four axes and one blank axis, the stair column with its tall entrance door; ground French windows and the entrance (residential pattern). 1 the north half (surfaces 13/210/157, which 3DBAG runs up to 20-22 m through the set-back grey metal-clad top volume): sparse thin strip windows staggered storey by storey on a blank brick wall, and the grey metal-clad bay at the foot of the north end (house 1, storeys 0-1 in grey); storey 6 in grey stands for the set-back metal top volume.",
  "Storey lines are approximate on group 1: the strip windows sit on split levels the kit storey grid does not follow; the bays were chosen so the two strip columns and the right-hand column of the photo land on bay centres.",
  "The top row of small dark openings over the south half is read as parapet openings of roof terraces (no glazing visible in the leaf-off crop) and is not drawn.",
  "otherWalls: the other walls of this large pand (archived crops w02-305, w06-215, w07-204, w09-307, w11-210, w12-348 exist) are not described in this pass and stay in the shader window grid."
 ]
